        CFD University, Cranfield University. Accessed 21 July 2026.
        <a href="https://cfd.university/blog/the-6-biggest-and-unoslved-challenges-in-cfd/">
          cfd.university <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
        </a>
      </li>
      <li>
        Slotnick, J., Khodadoust, A., Alonso, J., Darmofal, D., Gropp, W.,
        Lurie, E., and Mavriplis, D. <em>CFD Vision 2030 Study: A Path to
        Revolutionary Computational Aerosciences.</em> NASA/CR-2014-218178,
        NASA Langley Research Center, March 2014.
        <a href="https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20140003093">
