        </a>
      </li>
    </ol>
    <p class="note">
      The challenge numbering above follows Teschner's article. Every measured
      figure is copied from a committed artifact: a run under
      <a href={VERIFICATION_URL}>verification/ <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      or <a href={STUDIES_URL}>studies/ <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>,
      or an example’s <code>output.txt</code>. All were measured at <code>f64</code> in a release
